     "Skills are also an integration mechanism. Through the API, a Skill is attached to a request via the `container` parameter (container.skills), published and versioned through the `/v1/skills` endpoints, and managed under version control like any deployed asset. Skills on the API require the code execution tool, so the pattern carries a sandboxed execution dependency; weigh that alongside MCP and direct tool use when deciding how a reusable procedure reaches Claude across entry points.",
