    "why2": "Merging dense and sparse results by raw score. The scores are on different scales; rank-based fusion avoids the calibration problem.",
    "deep": "Anthropic's contextual-retrieval write-up combines BM25 and embedding results and deduplicates them with rank fusion techniques, and reports that adding Contextual BM25 to contextual embeddings improved retrieval beyond embeddings alone. (Source: https://www.anthropic.com/news/contextual-retrieval)",
