    "why": "These five takeaways map directly to the domain's exam objectives: eval design, POC-to-production readiness, and post-launch experimentation and diagnosis.",
    "why2": "Memorizing techniques without the decision rule that selects among them. Every trap above is a correct technique applied to the wrong situation.",
