    "why2": "Leading with the recommendation and offering the alternatives only if asked. That is a verdict; the stakeholder cannot defend a decision whose alternatives they never saw.",
    "deep": "Prompt caching caches the prompt prefix up to and including the block marked with cache_control (order: tools, system, messages). The default lifetime is 5 minutes, refreshed each time the cache is used, with a 1-hour option at additional cost. Cache reads are billed at a small fraction of base input price (0.1x for most models per the page at time of writing) while cache writes carry a premium, and there is a model-dependent minimum cacheable length. Check usage fields such as cache_read_input_tokens to verify hits. (Source: https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/prompt-caching)",
