    "why2": "Concluding that the CTO should have asked better questions. The architect owns making the decision informed; the stakeholder should not have to know which question to ask.",
    "links": [
     {
      "to": "pf6-cost-expectations",
      "dir": "leads-to",
      "why": "pre-empting the invoice surprise"
     }
    ]
