     "Think of the **handoff package** as the bundle of these artifacts plus a list of open items, each with an owner and resolution criteria. A code repository and a diagram are inputs to the package, not the package. The runbook should be derived from the governance table: for every trigger, what the on-call person does, who they escalate to, and what an SLA breach obliges them to report.",
