    "deep": "The Bedrock page notes newer models require an inference profile, and passing a base model ID fails with an HTTP 400; it also notes Bedrock does not support top-level cache_control (use explicit cache breakpoints) and caps request payloads at 20 MB. (Source: https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/build-with-claude/claude-on-amazon-bedrock)",
