    "why": "Exam options often include an over-engineered choice (build an SDK service) next to a managed one that fully meets the need. Prefer the least you have to build and operate.",
    "why2": "Reaching for the Agent SDK or a custom server for a daily report that a routine or scheduled Action would handle.",
