     "The fix and the lesson: add the runbook entry, add a quality signal (a scheduled eval run against a fixed set, with an alert threshold) next to the infrastructure metrics, and name an owner. With that path written down, a first-line engineer could have resolved it in an afternoon; without it, it waited for a review. Gradual degradation needs a measurement that can see it."
