     "3. When aggregate results disappoint, decompose before pivoting. Break cache hit rate down by ticket category to find where optimization pays off before switching models.",
     "4. Measure the total cost, not just API spend. Human review time is a real cost; report direct and total cost side by side rather than redefining the metric to look better.",
