     "Pattern across the six: first ask who the users are (non-technical users point to claude.ai with a Project). If the system must reach live data or embed in other software, you need a programmatic route; then let existing cloud commitments pick between Bedrock, Vertex AI, and the direct API. If a governance rule says the organization must own the audit trail, only a route behind the organization's own gateway satisfies it. If a regulated workload already has a confirmed compliance path (e.g., a BAA covering a specific Bedrock configuration), the existing path wins over a new one that achieves the same outcome with more procurement risk.",
