       "A commitment naming what is measured, what counts as a breach, and what happens on breach, with thresholds traced to user-experience expectations, business criticality or eval acceptance criteria.",
       "An arbitrary target is not an SLA; every threshold needs a source. Set latency thresholds on the tail (p95)."
